        "quote": "The first is a co-packaged optics, or CPO, chip series that can be integrated directly into graphics processing units. The company says that it’s capable of linking together thousands of GPUs. Lumilens also makes near-packaged optics, or NPO, chips. Such chips are not integrated directly into GPUs but rather sit on the motherboard that hosts them.",
